{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOSTIA BAY NEEDS YOU!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Capsule_Main.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hawaiian shirt, ripped sleeves, sunglasses, a true winner\u2019s tan, swept back gold and a rad stache. MOTOSCAFO is a man hard as a fossil cookie. He knows no fear when he\u2019s on a speedboat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MOTOSCAFO is the hero that takes on injustice, with no worry for consequences: he\u2019s the swag seafarer that fights Moneybags, Freebooters and Monstroni, for what good is left in the world</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE HERO OF ROOSTER SKULL ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Game_Pillar_3_Isola.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check the articles in <strong>Hostia News</strong> to see where's trouble, and bring MOTOSCAFO's help where is needed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHICA CHICA BOOM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Armeria.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your speedboat's loadout in Motore's <strong>Armory</strong>, and get out there to kick A LOT OF BOSSES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-29_135940.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapons, improve your speedboat and get ready to fight: monsters, marauders or moneybags, nothing and no one can stop MOTOSCAFO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Motoscafo_busto.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s weird. It\u2019s fun. It\u2019s MOTOSCAFO!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672640?t=1746201965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672640?t=1746201965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/7d1d6bb74a402cfe373305400e9d06bbfc4c3360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746201965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/7d1d6bb74a402cfe373305400e9d06bbfc4c3360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746201965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOSTIA BAY NEEDS YOU!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Capsule_Main.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hawaiian shirt, ripped sleeves, sunglasses, a true winner\u2019s tan, swept back gold and a rad stache. MOTOSCAFO is a man hard as a fossil cookie. He knows no fear when he\u2019s on a speedboat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MOTOSCAFO is the hero that takes on injustice, with no worry for consequences: he\u2019s the swag seafarer that fights Moneybags, Freebooters and Monstroni, for what good is left in the world</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE HERO OF ROOSTER SKULL ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672640/extras/Game_Pillar_3_Isola.png?t=1746201965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check the articles in <strong>Hostia News</strong>